 "body": "Updates the requirements on [pydantic](https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic) to permit the latest version.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/releases\">pydantic's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v2.14.3 2026-11-04</h2>\n<h2>v2.14.3 (2026-11-04)</h2>\n<h3>What's Changed</h3>\n<h4>Packaging</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Build wheels for GraalPy 3.13 by <a href=\"https://github.com/msimacek\"><code>@​msimacek</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14136\">#14136</a>.</p>\n<p>The previous v2.14.2 release published GraalPy 3.11 wheels, which were not working due to a PyO3 version bump. A CI workflow issue made it so that the wheel wasn't tested before publishing. This is now fixed: starting in v2.14.3, we no longer publish GraalPy 3.11 wheels, and GraalPy 3.13 wheels are now published together with the existing 3.12 one.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Performance</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Improve schema generation for fixed type handlers by <a href=\"https://github.com/alexmojaki\"><code>@​alexmojaki</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14130\">#14130</a></li>\n<li>Skip general schema dispatch for builtin scalars by <a href=\"https://github.com/alexmojaki\"><code>@​alexmojaki</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14141\">#14141</a></li>\n<li>Skip annotation handler setup when annotations are empty by <a href=\"https://github.com/alexmojaki\"><code>@​alexmojaki</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14149\">#14149</a></li>\n<li>Fix quadratic serialization time with per-index <code>include</code>/<code>exclude</code> on sequences by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14160\">#14160</a></li>\n<li>Avoid type lookups when checking for <code>None</code> during serialization by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14167\">#14167</a></li>\n<li>Improve performance of model serialization by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14171\">#14171</a></li>\n<li>Improve performance of dict serialization by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14172\">#14172</a></li>\n<li>Improve performance of type inference during serialization by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14173\">#14173</a></li>\n<li>Avoid cloning the field name when using the default value during validation by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14175\">#14175</a></li>\n<li>Do not evaluate <code>model_config</code> annotations by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14195\">#14195</a></li>\n<li>Avoid slow runtime <code>Protocol</code> check when expanding <code>GroupedMetadata</code> annotations by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14196\">#14196</a></li>\n<li>Use a lightweight <code>@contextmanager</code> implementation internally by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14199\">#14199</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Fixes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix various issues about GC tracking in <code>pydantic-core</code> by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/13819\">#13819</a></li>\n<li>Include <code>null</code> in serialization JSON Schema for <code>unless-none</code> field serializers by <a href=\"https://github.com/Kropiunig\"><code>@​Kropiunig</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/13848\">#13848</a></li>\n<li>Fix <code>RecursionError</code> when copying or unpickling models with <code>defer_build</code> by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14115\">#14115</a></li>\n<li>Remove dead <code>default_factory</code> check in unsupported <code>Field()</code> attribute by <a href=\"https://github.com/owtaylor\"><code>@​owtaylor</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14129\">#14129</a></li>\n<li>Disallow non string extra keys during validation by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14135\">#14135</a></li>\n<li>Fix deeply nested data being reported as a cyclic reference by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14164\">#14164</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>New Contributors</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/owtaylor\"><code>@​owtaylor</code></a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14129\">#14129</a></li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/blob/main/HISTORY.md\">pydantic's changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v2.14.3 (2026-11-04)</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/releases/tag/v2.14.3\">GitHub release</a></p>\n<h3>What's Changed</h3>\n<h4>Packaging</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Build wheels for GraalPy 3.13 by <a href=\"https://github.com/msimacek\"><code>@​msimacek</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14136\">#14136</a>.</p>\n<p>The previous v2.14.2 release published GraalPy 3.11 wheels, which were not working due to a PyO3 version bump. A CI workflow issue\nmade it so that the wheel wasn't tested before publishing. This is now fixed: starting in v2.14.3, we no longer publish GraalPy 3.11\nwheels, and GraalPy 3.13 wheels are now published together with the existing 3.12 one.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Performance</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Improve schema generation for fixed type handlers by <a href=\"https://github.com/alexmojaki\"><code>@​alexmojaki</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14130\">#14130</a></li>\n<li>Skip general schema dispatch for builtin scalars by <a href=\"https://github.com/alexmojaki\"><code>@​alexmojaki</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14141\">#14141</a></li>\n<li>Skip annotation handler setup when annotations are empty by <a href=\"https://github.com/alexmojaki\"><code>@​alexmojaki</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14149\">#14149</a></li>\n<li>Fix quadratic serialization time with per-index <code>include</code>/<code>exclude</code> on sequences by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14160\">#14160</a></li>\n<li>Avoid type lookups when checking for <code>None</code> during serialization by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14167\">#14167</a></li>\n<li>Improve performance of model serialization by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14171\">#14171</a></li>\n<li>Improve performance of dict serialization by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14172\">#14172</a></li>\n<li>Improve performance of type inference during serialization by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14173\">#14173</a></li>\n<li>Avoid cloning the field name when using the default value during validation by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14175\">#14175</a></li>\n<li>Do not evaluate <code>model_config</code> annotations by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14195\">#14195</a></li>\n<li>Avoid slow runtime <code>Protocol</code> check when expanding <code>GroupedMetadata</code> annotations by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14196\">#14196</a></li>\n<li>Use a lightweight <code>@contextmanager</code> implementation internally by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14199\">#14199</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Fixes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix various issues about GC tracking in <code>pydantic-core</code> by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/13819\">#13819</a></li>\n<li>Include <code>null</code> in serialization JSON Schema for <code>unless-none</code> field serializers by <a href=\"https://github.com/Kropiunig\"><code>@​Kropiunig</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/13848\">#13848</a></li>\n<li>Fix <code>RecursionError</code> when copying or unpickling models with <code>defer_build</code> by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14115\">#14115</a></li>\n<li>Remove dead <code>default_factory</code> check in unsupported <code>Field()</code> attribute by <a href=\"https://github.com/owtaylor\"><code>@​owtaylor</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14129\">#14129</a></li>\n<li>Disallow non string extra keys during validation by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14135\">#14135</a></li>\n<li>Fix deeply nested data being reported as a cyclic reference by <a href=\"https://github.com/Viicos\"><code>@​Viicos</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14164\">#14164</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>New Contributors</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/owtaylor\"><code>@​owtaylor</code></a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/14129\">#14129</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v2.14.2 (2026-10-29)</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/releases/tag/v2.14.2\">GitHub release</a></p>\n<h3>What's Changed</h3>\n<h4>Packaging</h4>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/commit/ea492e04654ab7f7a1f9287ea912419452ead4dd\"><code>ea492e0</code></a> Bump pydantic-core to v2.50.4</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/commit/4f4a33fe18e4bdf5ba35c01d86adcebc236f4703\"><code>4f4a33f</code></a> Prepare release v2.14.3</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/commit/dca067b563a0d77f3e99c9ccee4d8a28226a31ac\"><code>dca067b</code></a> Benchmark <code>TypedDict</code> schema generation across builds</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/commit/a2d1f6c8c50f9d2a27cd44a87147b3a1579ea99b\"><code>a2d1f6c</code></a> Skip annotation handler setup when annotations are empty</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/commit/3ae0a40c5e27e89899f8fb9fe9769351b79bce7c\"><code>3ae0a40</code></a> Construct builtin scalar union schemas directly</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/commit/358d36f850f4493b07612a8e3d0de166c376d1ad\"><code>358d36f</code></a> Skip general schema dispatch for builtin scalars</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/commit/3cc701a03fcd07bf91b4d775fefa6967685b4023\"><code>3cc701a</code></a> Improve schema generation for fixed type handlers</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/commit/762db7ecb4fbf0a7dc518359d21d8877c35a6dff\"><code>762db7e</code></a> Remove redundant None check in union schema generation</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/commit/c2149861252590ed3822762eda986760f8478d6e\"><code>c214986</code></a> Bump <code>pytest-codspeed</code> to v5.0.4</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/commit/038ee972494d838e898a8b1048a7fca27358c03d\"><code>038ee97</code></a> Bump <code>typing-inspection</code> to v0.4.5</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/compare/v2.0...v2.14.3\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n",
